{
  "name": "@huloglobal/vendure-plugin-fraud-prevention",
  "version": "0.17.1",
  "description": "Full fraud-prevention suite for Vendure: signal-based risk scoring (velocity, disposable emails, block/allow lists, CIDR ranges, high-risk countries, failed-payment patterns), real server-side enforcement with monitor/enforce modes, a manual review queue with approve/reject workflow, public threat-feed sync (FireHOL, Spamhaus DROP, Tor exits, disposable-email domains), and a multi-tab admin dashboard.",
